'''Revenge of Carnage (Merciless)''' is the second stage in [[River Acheron]]. When clearing this stage, the player is guaranteed to unlock the [[True Form]] of [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Express Cat]], Bullet Train Cat. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

