==Battleground==
*2 [[Znache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*4 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~8 seconds<sup>200f~240f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hannya]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
**4 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
**6 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The map is noticeably shorter than [[Realm of Carnage (Deadly)|Realm of Carnage]], which exacerbates any mistakes related to the burrowing patterns of [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]].

A functional strategy is to equip a hard-hitting [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer]], [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|dual]] [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Islands]], [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|dual]] [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Erasers]], [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Ectoweight Cat]] and [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]]. All there really is to do is spam both of your Islands and your main Zombie Killer. A [[Ototo Corps|Holy Blast Cannon]], level of which does not matter, is recommended here to prevent the Zir Zeals from cutting your units off.

It is usually helpful to stall and save up money at the beginning, as Hannya and company spawn only when the base is hit. Do not underestimate the pushing power of Ginger Snache and Znache, however, as you may soon find your own base under attack.

The stage can also be rushed due to lack of support for Hannya until later in the stage. See the walkthroughs below for more information.

